s=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">720 seconds<br/><small>(60% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.2<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 16, 2003<br/>Christmas Update 2003</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20120404171428&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Ham_40c7ee.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  dragon ham.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 30.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It still contains a small part of the power of a dragon.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Chomp.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Twice the regeneration of normal <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">ham</a>, yet only 50% heavier. It's a great food to eat while making runes. Lower leveled characters can easily collect them near <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lairs\">Dragon Lairs</a> because many players who hunt there throw it out of killed <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragons\">Dragons</a>.\nNeeded for the <a href=\"#/quest/demons-lullaby\">Demon's Lullaby</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Albino%20Dragon\">Albino Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demodras\">Demodras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\">Dragon Lord Hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Wyrm\">Elder Wyrm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eldritch%20Dragon%20Lord\">Eldritch Dragon Lord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon%20Hatchling\">Frost Dragon Hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gelidrazah%20the%20Frozen\">Gelidrazah the Frozen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Mother%20Foulscale\">Grand Mother Foulscale</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Dragon\">Ice Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Inkwing\">Inkwing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kalyassa\">Kalyassa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Seacrest%20Serpent\">Seacrest Serpent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tazhadur\">Tazhadur</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrn\">Tyrn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyrm\">Wyrm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyvern</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Loc